<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings more than double over week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings more than double over week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal jumped to 707,598 tonnes in the week to May 27, from 300,742 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Council said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bulk of the liftings, almost 70 percent or 494,148 tonnes, were destined for the Americas, the council said.</p>
